### Content summary

- **Purpose:** AI judgment on whether charts answer “so what?” beyond geometry; builds on `DET.CHART.ALT_SUMMARY`, `DET.DATA.TABLE_HEADERS`, and `DET.DATA.COLOR_ONLY`.
- **Passing / failing signals:** Takeaway titles, `forge-support` summaries, emphasis aligned with narrative, redundant encoding, accessible summaries.
- **Before:** `ks-section` + `ks-chart-mount` + generic `render_ks_chart_mount` caption only (fails insight legibility).
- **After:** `forge-card`, `card-label`, outcome `h2`, `aria-describedby` summary, amber peak emphasis, `lenses-overview-donut-swatch` legend (passes).
- **Evidence / remediation:** 5-step ordered fix list; related deterministic and AI rules.

### Real KS classes used

`ks-section`, `ks-section-title`, `forge-card`, `card-label`, `forge-support`, `ks-chart-mount`, `data-ks-chart`, `data-ks-chart-kind`, `data-ks-chart-state`, `lenses-overview-donut-swatch`, hashes `Dcs` / `data-ks-name="data-charts-static"`, chart kind `commit_weekly` from `render_ks_chart_mount` / `components/components.py`.

